    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a B2B sales qualification analyst for an AI automation agency.\n\nAnalyze the following lead.\n\nLead Information:\nName: {{ $json.lead.fullName }}\nEmail: {{ $json.lead.email }}\nCompany: {{ $json.lead.company }}\nWebsite: {{ $json.lead.website }}\nJob Title: {{ $json.lead.jobTitle }}\nIndustry: {{ $json.lead.industry }}\nCompany Size: {{ $json.lead.companySize }}\nNeed: {{ $json.lead.need }}\nBudget: {{ $json.lead.budget }}\nTimeline: {{ $json.lead.timeline }}\nMessage: {{ $json.lead.message }}\n\nIdeal Customer Profile:\n- Target company size: 10–500 employees\n- Target decision makers: Founder, CEO, COO, CTO, Head of Operations, or similar senior roles\n- Preferred budget: $1,000 or more\n- Strong preference for a clear AI or automation requirement\n- Stronger prospects have a specific business problem and a near-term implementation timeline\n\nDetermine:\n1. Whether the lead fits the ICP\n2. Buying intent\n3. Budget level\n4. Decision-making authority\n5. Strength of business need\n6. Project timeline\n7. Key pain points\n8. Recommended solution\n9. A concise qualification summary\n\nDo not invent information.\nIf something cannot be determined from the provided information, use \"Unknown\".",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -288,
        -32
      ],
      "id": "e67f85b4-73e8-486e-944a-80e912bfd6e6",
      "name": "Basic LLM Chain"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
